<title>NEW ZEALAND: FCL Forests year profit rises to NZ$74 mln.</title>
<headline>FCL Forests year profit rises to NZ$74 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				    74 vs 68</p>
<p>Shr (cents, before plantation holding cost adjustment)</p>
<p>						     9.2 vs same</p>
<p>    Share (cents, after adjustment)     17.5 vs 16.9</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  3.0 vs same</p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)		 6.0 vs same</p>
<p>    Turnover				     394 vs 351</p>
<p>    EBIT					    91 vs 98</p>
<p>    Pretax profit				 91 vs 99</p>
<p>    Tax						8 vs 20</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	   805 vs 739</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation tax credit credits.</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 6</p>
<p>Reg date Oct 25</p>
<p>    Ex div   Oct 29</p>
<p>Note - Fletcher Challenge Forests Division Ltd is a forest solid wood plantation forestry and logging company and part of the Fletcher Challenge Group. Market expectations were for a net earnings of around NZ$65 million.  </p>
<p>Balance sheet (in millions unless stated)</p>
<p>    Current assets			     102 vs 138</p>
<p>    Total assets (billion)		  1.51 vs 1.43</p>
<p>    Current liabilities			 90 vs 149</p>
<p>    Total liabilities			  601 vs 536</p>
<p>    Shareholders' equity		     906 vs 898</p>
<p>    Cashflow from operating activities   114 vs 151</p>
<p>Cashflow from investing activities (178) vs (86)</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
